// spec: 12 Runtime panics; 4 Types as values; 4 Type declarations
// panics: type-expr
// An unchecked run blames the member of an alias cycle declared first and lists the others, as
// the checker does, although the type expression reaches the cycle through a later member.
type A = C | null
type C = B
type B = C
println(type(A))

// expect
// exit: 1
// err: type C refers to itself through B without passing through a record, array, map, set, or function
